\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 1. Product Vision\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Build a 
\f0\b Netflix-style discovery platform for Telugu movie meme templates
\f1\b0 .\
The platform should allow Telugu meme creators to quickly find screenshots/templates from Telugu movies by searching or browsing:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
