\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 2. Problem\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Telugu meme creators frequently need a specific movie scene for a meme.\
Currently, the workflow is often:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Think of meme \uc0\u8594  remember a scene \u8594  search YouTube \u8594  find movie \u8594  find scene \u8594  screenshot \u8594  crop \u8594  create meme
\f1\b0 \
Instagram template pages make this easier, but templates are scattered across different accounts and posts.\
There is no dedicated, organized discovery experience for Telugu movie meme templates.\
This product creates one searchable library.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 3. Product Goal\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The MVP should make it extremely fast for a meme creator to go from:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 "I need that Mahesh Babu expression/dialogue."
\f1\b0 \
to:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 "Found it. Download."
\f1\b0 \
The product should prioritize 
\f0\b discovery and speed
\f1\b0 , not meme creation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

